WEBVTT

00:00:03.730 --> 00:00:05.470
Did you finish that assignment?

00:00:05.470 --> 00:00:07.420
Let's grab cutlet sandwiches after class.

00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:09.480
It's the student council president!

00:00:09.480 --> 00:00:11.140
President Faria!

00:00:11.140 --> 00:00:14.850
I need to submit the documentation 
to the Railroad Committee.

00:00:14.850 --> 00:00:17.870
Sorry to make you handle 
all the paperwork, Ellen.

00:00:17.870 --> 00:00:19.540
Oh, not at all!

00:00:19.540 --> 00:00:22.380
I much prefer routine work.

00:00:22.900 --> 00:00:23.620
Documentation?

00:00:24.050 --> 00:00:26.470
Because we destroyed the train.

00:00:26.470 --> 00:00:28.010
Are you in trouble?

00:00:28.770 --> 00:00:29.930
Listen to me.

00:00:30.650 --> 00:00:34.430
It was a small price to pay for you, Nemo.

00:00:34.760 --> 00:00:37.900
There's nothing more 
valuable than human life.

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:40.530
Incoming, incoming!

00:00:40.530 --> 00:00:41.810
Clear the way!

00:00:46.830 --> 00:00:48.340
Hey there, President.

00:00:48.340 --> 00:00:50.660
Jou, that cart...

00:00:50.660 --> 00:00:54.700
Oh, this is the Physis dragon 
that was ravaging Midland.

00:00:54.700 --> 00:00:57.460
Eatin' people, burnin' forests...

00:00:57.460 --> 00:00:58.570
Physis?

00:00:58.890 --> 00:01:00.970
This dragon serves them.

00:01:01.580 --> 00:01:04.150
You took care of it yourself?

00:01:04.150 --> 00:01:06.730
Sure did! It was easy, too.

00:01:08.690 --> 00:01:10.460
This is Jou Tsurugi.

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:15.830
Successor to Spike, the hero 
with a heart of blazing ice.

00:01:16.430 --> 00:01:19.720
That makes me the strongest 
of the Seven Knights.

00:01:21.350 --> 00:01:24.580
But... isn't this a living thing, too?

00:01:25.790 --> 00:01:27.870
It serves Physis.

00:01:27.870 --> 00:01:30.060
There's no telling how many 
thousands it's killed.

00:01:30.400 --> 00:01:33.210
Oh, yeah. I guess you're right.

00:01:34.020 --> 00:01:34.820
I'm sorry.

00:01:34.820 --> 00:01:36.790
Now make way.

00:01:36.790 --> 00:01:41.360
Gotta get this to the Alchemy Research
 Institute for testing before it thaws.

00:01:42.450 --> 00:01:45.430
Okay, I'm off! Here I go!

00:01:48.240 --> 00:01:50.810
He's quite something, isn't he?

00:01:50.810 --> 00:01:54.460
He's a member of our student 
council, the Seven Knights.

00:01:54.930 --> 00:01:56.570
The Seven Knights...

00:03:34.710 --> 00:03:40.300
<b>Chance Encounter\h\h\h-Granseed-</b>

00:03:43.870 --> 00:03:46.940
An emergency meeting implies trouble afoot.

00:03:47.790 --> 00:03:50.080
Have you heard anything, Shirley?

00:03:50.080 --> 00:03:54.710
No. I suspect it's another of our 
president's trademark whims, Gareth.

00:03:54.920 --> 00:03:58.090
Our president's such a slavedriver.

00:03:58.510 --> 00:04:01.340
This is about the recent increase 
in Physis activity, I suppose.

00:04:01.340 --> 00:04:03.470
Gildan, you mind?

00:04:03.470 --> 00:04:04.500
Go for it!

00:04:04.500 --> 00:04:05.720
Thanks.

00:04:06.830 --> 00:04:08.600
Show some table manners.

00:04:09.040 --> 00:04:11.210
Food tastes better when 
you eat with your hands!

00:04:17.110 --> 00:04:19.620
I see we're all present.

00:04:20.410 --> 00:04:21.740
Who's the human?

00:04:22.220 --> 00:04:23.990
U-Um...

00:04:24.290 --> 00:04:25.990
Say, I know you!

00:04:26.460 --> 00:04:27.990
Allow me to introduce you.

00:04:28.270 --> 00:04:29.690
This is Nemo.

00:04:29.690 --> 00:04:32.150
He's just come to Granseed.

00:04:32.150 --> 00:04:36.290
He's a new student, and the latest 
member of the Seven Knights.

00:04:38.360 --> 00:04:40.190
A new member?!

00:04:40.190 --> 00:04:41.010
No way!

00:04:41.340 --> 00:04:42.350
President.

00:04:42.350 --> 00:04:44.650
This is no joking matter.

00:04:44.650 --> 00:04:46.010
The Seven Knights are—

00:04:46.240 --> 00:04:49.500
The greatest of Granseed's successors,

00:04:49.500 --> 00:04:51.020
and the protectors of the world.

00:04:51.410 --> 00:04:54.770
And you believe this distracted 
young man is worthy of the name?

00:04:56.130 --> 00:04:57.680
Unacceptable.

00:04:58.830 --> 00:05:01.740
A new student with 
no practical battle experience?

00:05:01.740 --> 00:05:04.280
Ellen, why didn't you put a stop to this?

00:05:04.670 --> 00:05:09.040
You know me. I like to go with the flow.

00:05:09.760 --> 00:05:12.540
I defer completely to 
the president on such matters.

00:05:12.540 --> 00:05:14.900
I'm with Shirley.

00:05:14.900 --> 00:05:16.860
C'mon! A man's only as good as his muscles!

00:05:17.270 --> 00:05:20.670
You need a finely honed vessel 
for a hero to dwell in!

00:05:22.290 --> 00:05:24.330
Right, Gildan? Gareth?

00:05:24.330 --> 00:05:25.640
You agree, don't you?

00:05:25.640 --> 00:05:30.220
Y-Yeah, I dunno...
I'm not much for muscles myself.

00:05:30.220 --> 00:05:32.460
Elves place little value on musculature.

00:05:33.080 --> 00:05:35.380
Sheesh, you guys are no fun!

00:05:35.900 --> 00:05:38.190
My objection stands, President.

00:05:38.190 --> 00:05:40.580
I understand your concerns.

00:05:40.580 --> 00:05:45.570
But he managed to contract with 
a hero during his first time in action.

00:05:46.820 --> 00:05:48.250
Can that be?

00:05:48.250 --> 00:05:49.560
Impossible.

00:05:49.560 --> 00:05:51.580
Without any training or guidance?

00:05:51.810 --> 00:05:53.830
Ellen and I can attest to it.

00:05:54.080 --> 00:05:56.720
Pretty cool if it's true!

00:05:56.720 --> 00:05:59.330
No way. Gotta be some kind of trick.

00:05:59.790 --> 00:06:03.110
So, what hero did you contract with?

00:06:04.240 --> 00:06:05.710
I'm not sure.

00:06:06.000 --> 00:06:07.230
You're not sure?

00:06:07.230 --> 00:06:11.250
We converse with our heroes 
to receive their power.

00:06:11.250 --> 00:06:13.350
You can't contract with one
without knowing who it is.

00:06:14.060 --> 00:06:17.350
I heard his voice, 
but I don't know his identity.

00:06:17.350 --> 00:06:19.850
Hey, is this guy loopy or somethin'?

00:06:20.350 --> 00:06:22.360
I understand your unease.

00:06:22.660 --> 00:06:28.620
But my hero, Lady Eunomia, 
told me to have faith in him.

00:06:28.620 --> 00:06:30.240
I trust Lady Eunomia.

00:06:30.610 --> 00:06:32.870
And I believe in Nemo.

00:06:34.760 --> 00:06:37.180
Well, if you're that insistent...

00:06:38.450 --> 00:06:42.630
Jou, show him around the academy, won't you?

00:06:42.630 --> 00:06:43.630
Me?!

00:06:44.300 --> 00:06:48.340
You're such so influential, 
with friends all over the school.

00:06:48.640 --> 00:06:51.140
You're also the council's best warrior

00:06:51.140 --> 00:06:53.300
and immensely popular 
with the younger students.

00:06:53.300 --> 00:06:56.270
Yeah, fair. Can't argue with facts.

00:06:56.270 --> 00:06:59.850
So I thought you'd make
 a great caretaker for Nemo.

00:07:00.160 --> 00:07:02.600
Fine, leave him to me!

00:07:04.050 --> 00:07:06.610
Well, I said that to sound cool, but...

00:07:06.920 --> 00:07:09.930
Jeez, what a lousy errand.

00:07:10.940 --> 00:07:13.700
Sorry you got stuck dealing
 with a nobody like me...

00:07:14.620 --> 00:07:16.980
Who're you callin' a nobody?

00:07:16.980 --> 00:07:17.490
Hey!

00:07:19.370 --> 00:07:20.100
Listen here!

00:07:20.100 --> 00:07:22.430
The Seven Knights are the 
pinnacle of this academy!

00:07:22.430 --> 00:07:23.820
Its ultimate warriors!

00:07:23.820 --> 00:07:25.380
Now that you're one of us,

00:07:25.380 --> 00:07:27.340
I don't wanna hear any more "nobody" talk!

00:07:28.320 --> 00:07:29.660
I'm sorry.

00:07:29.660 --> 00:07:33.390
It just doesn't feel real to me...

00:07:35.490 --> 00:07:36.500
Look.

00:07:37.590 --> 00:07:41.460
The original Seven Knights. 
The heroes of legend.

00:07:41.460 --> 00:07:42.810
Those are...

00:07:42.810 --> 00:07:46.850
We've inherited their power.

00:07:46.850 --> 00:07:49.390
We're duty-bound to become worthy of them.

00:07:49.390 --> 00:07:52.700
And use that power... to protect people?

00:07:52.920 --> 00:07:56.100
That's right! That's why 
I work hard to get stronger!

00:07:56.100 --> 00:07:59.730
I'd gladly throw my life away 
to defend the world from Physis!

00:08:00.300 --> 00:08:02.710
That doesn't sound right.

00:08:03.590 --> 00:08:07.490
If you and the enemy both die...

00:08:07.490 --> 00:08:09.210
How do you protect people that way?

00:08:11.130 --> 00:08:12.720
The hell did you say?

00:08:13.080 --> 00:08:15.090
My, I see we're all having fun here.

00:08:22.020 --> 00:08:23.980
You must be Nemo, I presume?

00:08:24.230 --> 00:08:29.480
I'm told you heard the voice of the 
goddess and made your own hero card.

00:08:29.970 --> 00:08:31.780
It's all kind of a blur...

00:08:32.480 --> 00:08:33.490
Who are you?

00:08:34.030 --> 00:08:38.560
I am Sophitia. I serve 
as the academy librarian.

00:08:38.560 --> 00:08:39.620
The librarian?

00:08:40.210 --> 00:08:46.270
The academy library contains 
the memories of the heroes of old.

00:08:47.100 --> 00:08:52.240
After undergoing intense training,
our students make contracts with their cards

00:08:52.240 --> 00:08:55.380
and gain the power to fuse 
with a hero for combat.

00:08:55.880 --> 00:08:58.220
Such is the power of a successor.

00:08:58.890 --> 00:09:03.140
But there are some who are guided 
to their cards by fate alone.

00:09:04.140 --> 00:09:05.750
Just like you were.

00:09:05.750 --> 00:09:08.900
Guided by fate?

00:09:09.530 --> 00:09:13.130
You might become a beacon of hope to others.

00:09:13.130 --> 00:09:14.840
<i>This</i> guy?

00:09:14.840 --> 00:09:16.530
Oh, that's right, Jou.

00:09:16.870 --> 00:09:19.080
The Alchemy Research Institute was delighted.

00:09:19.080 --> 00:09:23.580
They said your frozen dragon 
will make a magnificent sample.

00:09:24.230 --> 00:09:25.410
I'm honored!

00:09:26.300 --> 00:09:28.150
Now, do get along.

00:09:28.150 --> 00:09:28.810
Yes, ma'am!

00:09:36.700 --> 00:09:39.150
Boy, what an awesome day.

00:09:39.150 --> 00:09:41.240
Miss Sophitia even talked to me...

00:09:44.460 --> 00:09:46.240
Now, let's get this over with.

00:09:46.240 --> 00:09:47.660
The cafeteria first!

00:09:51.900 --> 00:09:54.730
The Seven Knights...

00:10:07.260 --> 00:10:09.060
And here's your dorm.

00:10:09.060 --> 00:10:11.390
Whew, sweet freedom at last!

00:10:12.050 --> 00:10:13.960
Yeah. Thank you, Jou.

00:10:15.300 --> 00:10:17.260
You're such a weirdo.

00:10:17.960 --> 00:10:19.720
Get some rest already.

00:10:25.720 --> 00:10:27.230
Let's see...

00:10:33.980 --> 00:10:35.080
Faria?

00:10:36.650 --> 00:10:37.680
Welcome.

00:10:56.170 --> 00:10:59.180
<i>Do you feel anger toward that child?</i>

00:11:00.120 --> 00:11:02.840
Spike? Of course not.

00:11:03.110 --> 00:11:07.370
<i>Suppressed anger can be one's own undoing.</i>

00:11:07.780 --> 00:11:08.970
I just...

00:11:10.030 --> 00:11:11.850
I just wanna be strong.

00:11:20.940 --> 00:11:24.870
Are we the only three people in this dorm?

00:11:24.870 --> 00:11:25.920
Yes.

00:11:25.920 --> 00:11:29.870
This is the student council dorm, 
so it's just us here.

00:11:30.570 --> 00:11:33.000
Just us?

00:11:34.620 --> 00:11:36.500
Is that... okay?

00:11:36.500 --> 00:11:40.850
I'm also the president's 
personal valet, so I'm fine.

00:11:40.850 --> 00:11:43.510
Are you worried you're 
getting special treatment?

00:11:43.510 --> 00:11:45.640
Well... um...

00:11:46.750 --> 00:11:47.760
Kind of.

00:11:48.010 --> 00:11:50.770
I have high hopes for you.

00:11:50.770 --> 00:11:52.110
High hopes?

00:11:52.110 --> 00:11:53.020
Yes.

00:11:53.020 --> 00:11:56.550
You really think I can make a contribution?

00:11:56.550 --> 00:12:01.290
Successors who make contracts
outside of the library are special.

00:12:02.030 --> 00:12:05.530
When that happened... 
I was just following my instincts.

00:12:07.010 --> 00:12:09.290
I was utterly useless.

00:12:09.740 --> 00:12:12.570
You must be feeling 
a lot of pressure right now.

00:12:12.570 --> 00:12:16.410
But I'm sure you'll find a way to contribute.

00:12:17.930 --> 00:12:21.270
Long ago, in the age of distant legend,

00:12:21.270 --> 00:12:24.980
there lived a group of heroes 
known as the Seven Knights.

00:12:24.980 --> 00:12:28.260
They traveled the land, 
sometimes in harmony,

00:12:28.260 --> 00:12:30.990
sometimes in conflict, 
competing to change the fate of the world.

00:12:32.140 --> 00:12:37.060
And when Evil God Nestra tried 
to cast our world into darkness,

00:12:37.060 --> 00:12:42.070
the heroes rose to the challenge 
of keeping us all safe.

00:12:42.640 --> 00:12:45.070
You successors were chosen by the goddess...

00:12:45.920 --> 00:12:49.230
<i>A way I can contribute?</i>

00:12:52.840 --> 00:12:54.140
How's that assignment going?

00:12:54.140 --> 00:12:55.560
What assignment?

00:12:55.560 --> 00:12:56.950
Wait, don't tell me...

00:12:58.480 --> 00:13:00.090
The new student?

00:13:00.540 --> 00:13:02.460
I met you yesterday...

00:13:03.050 --> 00:13:03.920
Gareth.

00:13:04.640 --> 00:13:06.970
Gareth of the Winswald Clan.

00:13:07.300 --> 00:13:11.240
I know... Could you take this to 
the Alchemy Research Institute?

00:13:11.830 --> 00:13:13.980
Sure... but why?

00:13:14.460 --> 00:13:16.850
I'm not entirely comfortable there.

00:13:16.850 --> 00:13:18.660
I'd appreciate it if you could.

00:13:18.660 --> 00:13:19.760
You got it.

00:13:22.730 --> 00:13:24.400
<i>He's awfully obedient.</i>

00:13:25.760 --> 00:13:28.690
<i>Or is he just presenting that way?</i>

00:13:40.880 --> 00:13:42.790
Thank you so much!

00:13:42.790 --> 00:13:45.340
Elf medicine is just the best!

00:13:45.740 --> 00:13:47.840
Well, I'm just the delivery boy...

00:13:47.840 --> 00:13:49.040
Oh, don't say that!

00:13:49.040 --> 00:13:52.440
You'll give my regards to Gareth, won't you?

00:13:52.440 --> 00:13:53.360
Sure thing.

00:13:53.360 --> 00:13:56.620
Oh, Gareth is just the coolest!

00:13:56.620 --> 00:13:58.650
Don't you know, don't you know?

00:13:58.650 --> 00:14:02.860
He's Granseed's most cuddleable boy!

00:14:02.860 --> 00:14:06.110
You know what I'm saying?!

00:14:06.110 --> 00:14:09.110
I do! I do! I think...

00:14:09.110 --> 00:14:12.870
Gosh dern. Keep it down already, Claire.

00:14:13.390 --> 00:14:14.990
You again?

00:14:14.990 --> 00:14:16.080
Jou!

00:14:16.580 --> 00:14:20.290
Hey, being an errand-boy suits you.

00:14:20.580 --> 00:14:23.090
Yeah, I was thinking that, too.

00:14:24.040 --> 00:14:27.260
Have a little self-respect, man...

00:14:29.380 --> 00:14:30.260
What was that?

00:14:30.260 --> 00:14:31.300
An explosion?

00:14:31.300 --> 00:14:32.600
It came from the warehouse!

00:14:33.410 --> 00:14:34.600
Oh, crap!

00:14:41.340 --> 00:14:42.430
Damn it!

00:14:42.430 --> 00:14:44.610
I thought I took that thing out!

00:14:45.010 --> 00:14:46.840
What did you guys do to it?

00:14:46.840 --> 00:14:48.300
Nothing!

00:14:48.300 --> 00:14:49.970
It was frozen solid!

00:14:49.970 --> 00:14:50.990
Look!

00:14:52.040 --> 00:14:53.350
Miss Sophitia!

00:14:53.350 --> 00:14:54.330
We have to save her!

00:14:54.330 --> 00:14:55.200
No kiddin'!

00:14:55.580 --> 00:14:57.440
Spike, Master of Cold!

00:14:57.440 --> 00:14:58.840
Grant me your power!

00:14:58.840 --> 00:15:00.170
Succession!

00:15:01.710 --> 00:15:04.920
Roar, Ice Blade!

00:15:08.010 --> 00:15:09.010
Wow!

00:15:09.010 --> 00:15:13.140
Now that's what you call an ice-cold strike!

00:15:13.870 --> 00:15:16.010
There's nothin' I can't freeze!

00:15:17.250 --> 00:15:18.470
Miss Sophitia!

00:15:18.470 --> 00:15:19.930
Thank you, Jou.

00:15:19.930 --> 00:15:21.770
The Seven Knights truly are amazing.

00:15:22.030 --> 00:15:23.180
N-Not at all!

00:15:23.180 --> 00:15:24.770
There is still lots more to be done!

00:15:24.770 --> 00:15:28.320
New kid! You take Miss Sophitia
 and the others somewhere safe.

00:15:28.320 --> 00:15:29.150
Got it.

00:15:30.750 --> 00:15:32.630
No urgency at all, huh?

00:15:32.630 --> 00:15:34.160
I don't like that guy.

00:15:36.460 --> 00:15:40.490
I beat you already! Take a hint, man!

00:15:42.290 --> 00:15:43.880
Die!

00:15:55.210 --> 00:15:57.850
Well? Ready to stay dead yet?

00:16:02.680 --> 00:16:03.400
What?!

00:16:08.070 --> 00:16:09.410
Is that...

00:16:09.410 --> 00:16:11.260
<i>The power of Physis.</i>

00:16:11.260 --> 00:16:14.070
<i>Be careful. It's far stronger than before.</i>

00:16:23.370 --> 00:16:24.750
I've still got this!

00:16:29.800 --> 00:16:33.020
Snowfield Slash!

00:16:44.690 --> 00:16:45.830
Damn it...

00:16:45.830 --> 00:16:46.600
Jou!

00:16:46.600 --> 00:16:47.980
New kid!

00:16:48.550 --> 00:16:49.610
This one's trouble.

00:16:49.940 --> 00:16:51.830
Get the president here—and fast!

00:16:51.830 --> 00:16:53.320
I'll hold it back!

00:16:53.320 --> 00:16:54.950
You need to get out of here, too!

00:16:55.750 --> 00:16:57.330
Don't be stupid!

00:16:57.330 --> 00:16:59.910
If I leave, it'll head out into the city.

00:16:59.910 --> 00:17:01.950
Then the damage'll only get worse.

00:17:05.210 --> 00:17:08.420
But... who's going to protect <i>you?</i>

00:17:08.420 --> 00:17:09.210
What?

00:17:09.210 --> 00:17:12.960
Faria told me that there's nothing
 more valuable than human life.

00:17:12.960 --> 00:17:16.720
So yours is worth protecting, too!

00:17:17.010 --> 00:17:18.540
Shut up!

00:17:18.540 --> 00:17:20.460
That's no reason for me to back down...

00:17:21.600 --> 00:17:24.590
Or are you offering to contribute somehow?!

00:17:26.070 --> 00:17:26.980
I'll try!

00:17:26.980 --> 00:17:28.150
What?

00:17:28.980 --> 00:17:30.400
Succession!

00:17:53.710 --> 00:17:55.600
My goodness!

00:18:00.610 --> 00:18:02.090
You stupid idiot!

00:18:02.090 --> 00:18:04.890
You don't have the muscles 
for that! Fall back!

00:18:04.890 --> 00:18:08.220
Now! Freeze it over!

00:18:08.700 --> 00:18:10.650
You said you could freeze anything, right?!

00:18:10.650 --> 00:18:13.400
You stupid little... Fine! It's your funeral!

00:18:14.140 --> 00:18:16.420
There! Aim for the wound!

00:18:20.670 --> 00:18:23.580
Soul of Spike, respond to my anger!

00:18:23.580 --> 00:18:25.160
Freeze everything in your path!

00:18:26.010 --> 00:18:29.540
<i>I hear and obey! Burn, my icy heart!</i>

00:18:29.540 --> 00:18:31.500
<i>Turn this place into a frozen hell!</i>

00:18:49.890 --> 00:18:53.270
Hey, idiot! Get away! You've done enough!

00:18:53.270 --> 00:18:55.770
I can't! If I let go now...

00:18:55.770 --> 00:18:57.280
Listen to me, damn it!

00:18:57.670 --> 00:19:00.070
Almost there! I'm almost there!

00:19:00.070 --> 00:19:02.180
I have to stop this!

00:19:02.180 --> 00:19:03.030
<i>That's right.</i>

00:19:06.020 --> 00:19:08.490
<i>This is a life twisted by Physis.</i>

00:19:08.910 --> 00:19:13.540
<i>It dies, yet continues to move without life.</i>

00:19:14.580 --> 00:19:17.550
A life... without life?

00:19:18.000 --> 00:19:19.820
<i>End this tragedy.</i>

00:19:20.300 --> 00:19:23.590
Faria saved my life.

00:19:24.660 --> 00:19:26.060
So this time...

00:19:31.580 --> 00:19:32.550
Is that...

00:19:42.300 --> 00:19:44.950
<i>Do you see, Jou? That's its core.</i>

00:19:45.200 --> 00:19:47.950
<i>That's what allows its body to regenerate.</i>

00:19:48.460 --> 00:19:49.740
Leave it to me.

00:19:49.740 --> 00:19:51.460
I'll smash it to bits!

00:20:21.320 --> 00:20:22.440
A long time ago...

00:20:23.390 --> 00:20:27.100
the city where I lived was 
attacked by Physis's monsters.

00:20:28.590 --> 00:20:30.080
My dad was a successor.

00:20:30.700 --> 00:20:34.010
He stood against them all alone

00:20:34.010 --> 00:20:35.740
and died protecting the city.

00:20:37.530 --> 00:20:41.710
I want to be strong. Like my dad.

00:20:43.600 --> 00:20:46.720
You want to protect people too.

00:20:47.580 --> 00:20:50.360
I got stronger to do exactly that.

00:20:50.940 --> 00:20:53.420
But I can still get stronger...

00:20:54.430 --> 00:20:55.180
Jou...

00:20:56.560 --> 00:20:59.860
...so long as I'm with a gutsy punk like you.

00:21:01.360 --> 00:21:04.490
Oh, come on! You don't 
wanna hang out with me?

00:21:07.580 --> 00:21:08.990
Of course I do.

00:21:09.870 --> 00:21:11.180
Thank you.

00:21:11.180 --> 00:21:13.000
I'm happy to have you, Jou.

00:21:16.590 --> 00:21:19.820
He might just save us all.

00:22:03.870 --> 00:22:07.000
This concludes the report from 
the Alchemy Research Institute.

00:22:07.580 --> 00:22:09.680
Fortunately, there were no casualties,

00:22:09.680 --> 00:22:12.380
but we recovered little data.

00:22:12.380 --> 00:22:15.030
We'll consider no loss of life a victory.

00:22:15.810 --> 00:22:19.130
President, I want to ask you something.

00:22:19.580 --> 00:22:21.070
About Nemo?

00:22:22.530 --> 00:22:25.970
He's too naive and vulnerable.

00:22:25.970 --> 00:22:27.820
He should at least start basic training.

00:22:28.410 --> 00:22:33.210
In all truth, I'm a bit afraid of his power.

00:22:33.860 --> 00:22:35.340
Afraid?

00:22:35.340 --> 00:22:39.340
I think he's a very kind person himself.

00:22:40.480 --> 00:22:42.710
But that power...

00:22:44.140 --> 00:22:47.720
President, do you intend to monitor Nemo?

00:22:47.720 --> 00:22:52.140
That's the board's inclination, 
but... I worry.

00:22:52.740 --> 00:22:56.470
I'm afraid he might be 
swallowed by that power.

00:22:57.100 --> 00:22:59.350
Which is why you put him in that dorm?

00:23:00.090 --> 00:23:01.360
Just in case.

00:23:02.650 --> 00:23:07.090
The disciplinary board won't interfere, then.

00:23:07.090 --> 00:23:08.220
Excuse me.

00:23:14.250 --> 00:23:19.000
I want to believe in Nemo, Lady Eunomia.

00:23:25.820 --> 00:23:28.050
The monsters grow stronger every day.

00:23:28.050 --> 00:23:30.590
What we need is the power of more heroes.

00:23:30.590 --> 00:23:32.580
I'm doing my best, of course...

00:23:32.580 --> 00:23:34.440
But it's important to get results!

00:23:34.660 --> 00:23:40.250
<b>Hero -Seven Knights-</b>

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:36.760
Next time on <i>Seven Knights</i>...

00:23:36.760 --> 00:23:39.380
Do you kill those who don't get results?
